 "tags": [
  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Chatbot API (2017-10-11). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Amazon Chime webhook configurations, custom actions and account preferences are stored metadata: no SNS topic is subscribed, no message is posted to any webhook or chat channel, no command or custom action runs and no role is assumed. WebhookUrl is accepted but neither stored nor contacted, as AWS never returns it; SNS topic and role ARNs are not checked. Slack and Microsoft Teams configurations, workspace and user identities and associations return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501 because they need OAuth authorization with an external chat system. GetAccountPreferences omits preferences that were never updated instead of reporting service defaults.",
   "name": "AWS Chatbot"
  }
 ],
